          "snippet": "However, isoprenaline-stimulated UCP1 expression and oxygen consumption rate were reduced by dexamethasone treatment [  99  ]. In this study, 1 or 10 μM dexamethasone was used [  99  ], whereas another study treated human primary brown adipocytes with cortisol for up to 1 μM [  32  ]. Notably, dexamethasone is approximately 10 times more potent than cortisol.",
